[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11461.99, "timestamp": "03:11:01", "text": "我看过 我没看过 我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11464.23, "timestamp": "03:11:04", "text": "我知道，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11468.95, "timestamp": "03:11:08", "text": "例如，不包括公司"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11471.19, "timestamp": "03:11:11", "text": "就我个人而言，我还没见过任何人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11474.95, "timestamp": "03:11:14", "text": "做不到。所以，我就像要进去一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11477.99, "timestamp": "03:11:17", "text": "盲目地，没有任何先验知识。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11484.79, "timestamp": "03:11:24", "text": "我敢打赌，如果有一个印度机构的话……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11486.71, "timestamp": "03:11:26", "text": "在印度，他们会造就一个印度人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11488.469, "timestamp": "03:11:28", "text": "偶像骗局，骗取了那些赢家的钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11490.55, "timestamp": "03:11:30", "text": "试镜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11493.83, "timestamp": "03:11:33", "text": "我们还没看到这种情况。在这里，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11496.15, "timestamp": "03:11:36", "text": "这里还没见过雅戈的梦境。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11511.11, "timestamp": "03:11:51", "text": "我只是在等某个机构……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11515.99, "timestamp": "03:11:55", "text": "就像公司那样，嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11519.269, "timestamp": "03:11:59", "text": "嗯，3D演唱会之类的，还有类似一个区域"}]